  "system": {
    "slug": "kelly-chambers",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 5
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Yeoman Kelly Chambers served aboard the Normandy SR-2 as the Commanding Officer's personal assistant and crew morale specialist, though she was also a Cerberus operative providing psychological evaluations of the crew. She is warm, empathetic, and genuinely caring — her Cerberus loyalties were never fully resolved, and she may be encountered in a variety of contexts.</p><p><strong>Empathic Insight:</strong> Kelly has a +4 circumstance bonus to Sense Motive and Diplomacy checks. Once per encounter, she can attempt to de-escalate a conflict with a DC 20 Diplomacy check, causing a non-hostile creature who fails to pause combat for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Psychological Profile:</strong> Having observed the PCs previously, Kelly has a profile on each one. She gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Deception checks against any creature she has spoken with for more than 10 minutes.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
